  "system": {
    "identifier": "jiton-magnet-release-dust-particle-drizzle",
    "description": "<p>You form a mass of dust particles in front of you, firing a wave of dust bullets. Each creature of your choice within a 30-foot cone, must make a Dexterity saving throw.</p>\n<p>Critical Success: Affected creature takes half of 1d12 Earth Damage and 1d12 Piercing Damage.</p>\n<p>Success: Affected creature takes half of 1d12 Earth Damage and 1d12 Piercing Damage and the affected creature is Dazzled until the end of their next turn.</p>\n<p>Failure: Affected creatures takes 1d12 Earth Damage and 1d12 Piercing Damage and the affected creature is Sealed and Bruised.</p>\n<p>Critical Failure: Same as failure, but the affected creature takes 2d12 Earth Damage and 2d12 Piercing Damage.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, and both damage types by 1d12. If this jutsu is cast at C-Rank or higher, increase ranks of Sealed by +1. If this jutsu is cast at B-Rank or higher, increase the size of the cone by +10 feet. If this jutsu is cast at A-Rank or higher, increase ranks of Dazzled by +1. If this jutsu is cast at S-Rank, increase the size of the cone by +10 feet.</p>",
